fix(verification): unverified pros show nothing — remove inline warning + "Sin verificar" label

Client-facing surfaces only (documented explanation on /proveedores-autorizados +
Terms kept intact):
- Search card: unverified badge removed (verifiedBadge → null; only "Verificado"
  shows). Dropped the now-unused ShieldAlert import.
- Public profile: header shows the "Verificado" text only when verified (no
  negative label otherwise); the "Sobre mí" Verificación row now renders only for
  verified pros. Dropped unused ShieldAlert import.
- Booking modal: removed the "Este profesional aún no ha verificado su identidad.
  Coordina con cuidado." notice.
Pro's own dashboard/verification panel (their actionable status + how to verify)
is unchanged.

